[[:db/retract 17592186134550 :question/answer-fields 17592186133338] {:db/id 17592186360774 :question/problem "Consider the standard Hermitian inner product $⟨\\,\\cdot \\,,\\,\\cdot \\,⟩$ over $C.$ \nWhich of the following statements are true? \n\nI. $⟨a,a⟩\\in R$ for any $a\\in {C}^{n}$\n\nII. $⟨a,\\alpha b⟩=\\alpha ⟨a,b⟩$ for any $a,b\\in {C}^{n}$ and any $\\alpha \\in C$\n\nIII. $⟨a,b⟩=⟨b,a⟩$ for any $a,b\\in {C}^{n}$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186360783 :question/problem "Consider the standard Hermitian inner product $⟨\\,\\cdot \\,,\\,\\cdot \\,⟩$ over $C.$ \nWhich of the following statements are true? \n\nI. $⟨a,b⟩=\\overset{―}{⟨a,b⟩}$ for any $a,b\\in {C}^{n}$\n\nII. $i⟨a,b⟩=⟨a,-ib⟩$ for any  $a,b\\in {C}^{n}$\n\nIII. There is vector $a\\in {C}^{n}$ such that  $⟨a,a⟩<0$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186272227 :question/problem "Consider the standard Hermitian inner product $⟨\\,\\cdot \\,,\\,\\cdot \\,⟩$ over $C.$ \nWhich of the following statements are true? \n\nI. $⟨ia,b⟩=i⟨a,b⟩$ for any $a,b\\in {C}^{n}$\n\nII. $⟨a,\\overset{―}{\\alpha }b⟩=⟨\\alpha a,b⟩$ for any $a,b\\in {C}^{n}$ and any $\\alpha \\in C$\n\nIII. $⟨ia,a⟩\\in R$ for any $a\\in {C}^{n}$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "activity-871d2b00-341d-5ec3-92a3-8fd5aa7eca28" :activity/id #uuid "871d2b00-341d-5ec3-92a3-8fd5aa7eca28" :activity/title "The Inner Product in Vector Spaces Over the Complex Numbers" :activity/type :activity.type/review :activity/scope 17592186050993 :activity/course 17592186046660 :activity/steps ["step-ff45ad40-043f-5835-bb86-3d1e620fd852" "step-22a3d38c-45ed-5261-9a9f-bdb8efdf26a5" "step-042f271a-62ae-5a4a-884d-ff79b9db9024" "step-c0e9081f-8d78-5a6a-b192-5ac752a618f5" "step-4ce6b6ce-a0a5-5ded-b78a-9436ef265d55"] :activity/first-step "step-ff45ad40-043f-5835-bb86-3d1e620fd852" :db/ensure [:activity/validate]} {:db/id "step-ff45ad40-043f-5835-bb86-3d1e620fd852" :step/id #uuid "ff45ad40-043f-5835-bb86-3d1e620fd852" :step/content 1